   "name": "C1-E20 text 43"
  },
  {
   "x": 8.370000000000001,
   "y": 2.65,
   "w": 4.48,
   "h": 0.4736111111111111,
   "text": "With c = 1500 m/s and M* = 0.1 the ideal\ncollapse reaches M* at R = 0.143 Rₘₐₓ.",
